Build and run the local RLE environment container

Usage
  azd ai rle run [flags]

Flags
      --dockerfile string : Dockerfile path relative to the current folder. Defaults to Dockerfile at the source root or server/Dockerfile.
      --port int          : Host port mapped to the local Docker container. Defaults to 8000.
      --watch             : Watch source files and rebuild/restart the local container when they change.

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string         : Sets the current working directory
      --debug              : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help               : help for run
      --no-prompt          : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string      : The output format (default "default")

Examples
  Build and run the local environment
    azd ai rle run

  Rebuild when local source files change
    azd ai rle run --watch
